","h":"evanrawal.bsky.social","o":"Denver Gazette","t":"Gabriel Landeskog wasn’t about to let Artyom Levshunov have an easy night after his questionable hit on Cale Makar.\n\nAnother reminder of why he wears the C. \n\nwww.denvergazette.com/2026/11/02/l...","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/evanrawal.bsky.social/post/3mzf3vy2qzc2c"},{"a":"Evan Rawal","d":"2026-11-03T02:25:22+00:00","h":"evanrawal.bsky.social","o":"Denver Gazette","t":"Landeskog has been chatting with Levshunov this period after that hit on Makar.\n\nCaptain just got some payback, as Levshunov decided to go airborne to smack the puck out of mid-air and Landeskog \"just happened\" to be under him when he went to land.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/evanrawal.bsky.social/post/3mzerwrnmes27"},{"a":"Evan Rawal","d":"2026-11-03T01:56:57+00:00","h":"evanrawal.bsky.social","o":"Denver Gazette","t":"Regarding the GI call: At some point we have to account for the fact that Knight wasn't stopping that puck. \n\nThe contact came right as the puck was going past him, Landeskog wasn't in the crease, and Knight wasn't even looking anywhere near where the puck was going.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/evanrawal.bsky.social/post/3mzeqdxentc2h"}],"team":"COL","threads":[{"d":"2026-11-11T00:55:21+00:00","sub":"hockey","t":"[tictactomar] Gabriel Landeskog gives Colorado the lead after contact with Bobrovsky by Roy. No challenge from the Leafs","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/hockey/comments/1xt436t/tictactomar_gabriel_landeskog_gives_colorado_the/"},{"d":"2026-11-05T05:19:02+00:00","sub":"hockey","t":"[NHL Public Relations on X] Adrian Kempe scored his fifth career hat trick and tied Gabriel Landeskog for the fourth most among active Swedish players behind Filip Forsberg (11), Mika Zibanejad (10) and Viktor Arvidsson…","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/hockey/comments/1xoagk5/nhl_public_relations_on_x_adrian_kempe_scored_his/"}],"videos":[{"d":"2026-10-31T18:54:56+00:00","id":"bOCeK_YwUDQ","k":"video","t":"Landeskog scared all of them 😂","team":"COL","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bOCeK_YwUDQ"}]}